    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5424" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμόργη</span></b> , ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμέργω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>watery part which runs out when olives are pressed,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Aph.</u>
				7.45
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>CP</u>
				6.8.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.102
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> kind of
